## Research
Validation of #877 findings against current HEAD. See docs/research/cancel-slot-validation.md.

Key findings:
- Dependency #870 archived (complete). CancelSignal + LinkedCancelSignal stable.
- All pipeline methods accept cancel= param. Toolset methods do not yet pass it (the gap).
- CancelSlot is ~10 LOC, maps to .NET CancellationTokenSource pattern. .90 confidence.
- BootstrapResult is non-frozen dataclass, safe to extend.
- No AC changes needed. Ready for architect gate.